{"id":"pare","lemma":"pare","pos":"noun","rank":1803,"glosses":["stop, an act of stopping","stop sign"],"ipa":"/ˈpaɾe/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"pares"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/69/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-pare.wav","examples":[{"text":"Iremos cuando pare de llover.","en":"We'll go when the rain stops.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/537996"},{"text":"Por favor, no pares.","en":"Please don't stop.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/164742"},{"text":"Le dije a Tom que pare.","en":"I told Tom to stop.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799470"},{"text":"Será mejor que pares.","en":"You'd better leave it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459284"},{"text":"Esperemos hasta que la lluvia pare.","en":"Let's wait for the rain to stop.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/585775"}]}